abstract: "An explicit family of exact-output-dimension weak lossless rank extractors over every fixed finite field, with a constant success fraction. Gives a positive answer to Guo, Raj, Shangguan, and Zhang, arXiv:2604.13431v2, Section 7, item 5, in the stated indexed-family setting."
